2026-11-07T06:33:13.5003583Z 3. Create the system users [34m(uids [30001..30008])[0m and groups [34m(gid 30000)[0m
2026-11-07T06:33:13.5004674Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
2026-11-07T06:33:13.5005580Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
2026-11-07T06:33:13.5006244Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
2026-11-07T06:33:13.5006601Z 
2026-11-07T06:33:13.5007270Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
2026-11-07T06:33:13.5007792Z 
2026-11-07T06:33:13.5008188Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
2026-11-07T06:33:13.5008889Z    can use Nix.
2026-11-07T06:33:13.5009141Z 
2026-11-07T06:33:13.5009335Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
2026-11-07T06:33:13.5009668Z 
2026-11-07T06:33:13.5010385Z [32m[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
2026-11-07T06:33:13.5011229Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
2026-11-07T06:33:13.5012560Z 
2026-11-07T06:33:13.5012760Z I will:
2026-11-07T06:33:13.5013095Z 
2026-11-07T06:33:13.5013752Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-11-07T06:33:13.5028899Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-11-07T06:33:13.5030082Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-11-07T06:33:13.5031358Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-11-07T06:33:13.5035440Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-11-07T06:33:13.5036305Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-11-07T06:33:13.5037603Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-11-07T06:33:13.5038658Z    /root
2026-11-07T06:33:13.5046144Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-07T06:33:13.5052468Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-07T06:33:13.5066136Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
2026-11-07T06:33:13.5071992Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
2026-11-07T06:33:13.5072642Z 
2026-11-07T06:33:13.5073499Z [32m[4;32mReady to continue?
2026-11-07T06:33:13.5074272Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
